OL,3,GNEWSAShuttle service launched due to
OL,4,Afault with ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shuttle service has been put in place
OL,7,Fbetween Portsmouth and the Isle of
OL,8,FWight as a passenger ferry is
OL,9,Fexperiencing a mechanical issue.
OL,11,FWightlink said its ferry service from
OL,12,FPortsmouth Harbour to Ryde Pier Head
OL,13,FFastCat has been affected by a problem
OL,14,Fwith the vessel's exhaust.
OL,16,FBut the firm said a shuttle service
OL,17,Foperated by a charter vessel is running
OL,18,F"until further notice". Wightlink added
OL,19,Fthat crossing times were expected to be
OL,20,Fabout 30 to 40 minutes and may vary.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
