OL,3,GNEWSAShuttle service launched due to
OL,4,Afault with ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after all FastCat services
OL,7,Fwere suspended on Sunday and several
OL,8,Fhovercraft crossings between Ryde and
OL,9,FSouthsea were cancelled on Saturday.
